# 统一使用 LF，避免 Windows 下 CRLF 造成 diff 噪声。
# 例外：Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.wasm binary

# 锁文件按文本处理，便于 review
pnpm-lock.yaml text eol=lf
Cargo.lock text eol=lf
